  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfterSchool Tutoring for PACOs Children Home</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The children&apos;s home provides comprehensive care to an average of 43 children and adolescents per year. Each one of them attends a formal educational institution in Mexico, however, after school activities are necessary that allow them to reinforce what they have learned in class, do their homework and continue developing skills to become the leaders of the future. For this we have a team of educators who strive every day to provide the support and affection that children need.</narrative>
  </description>
